Output demos/showcase.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1440
Set Height 900
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set WindowBar Colorful

Env XDG_STATE_HOME "/tmp/chess-analyzer-vhs-state"
Type "uv run chess-analyzer --file demos/supi-vs-carlsen.pgn --time 0.3 --lines 5"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Down
Right
Sleep 6s
Right
Sleep 6s
Down@400ms 4
Right
Sleep 6s
Right
Sleep 6s
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
